"""
tests/test_groq_tpm_fix.py — Comprehensive tests for Groq TPM 413 error resolution.

Validates:
  1. Configurable context budget and TPM limit recognition for models (e.g. groq/openai/gpt-oss-20b).
  2. Safe trimming & summarization of old conversation messages while preserving latest user prompt & system prompt.
  3. Saved chat history in storage/memory is NEVER deleted or mutated to reduce request size.
  4. Detection of oversized prompts where essential prompt exceeds model capacity.
  5. Accurate HTTP 413/429 parsing, including status code, headers, retry_after, limit, and requested tokens.
  6. Recovery on 413 via eligible alternative verified-free model with rebudgeted payload.
  7. Short retry-after wait & retry with reduced context vs long retry-after non-blocking exit.
  8. Prevention of infinite fallback loops and avoiding sending identical oversized payloads.
  9. Strict free-only policy enforcement (never falling back to paid or unverified models).
  10. Context budgeting during tool execution follow-up turns.
"""

